          "text": "According to Merck Sharp & Dohme Corp., according to Merck Sharp & Dohme Corp., merck argues that if a manufacturer informs the FDA of a possible risk and unsuccessfully asks to revise its label in light of that risk, failure\u2011to\u2011warn claims based on that risk are pre\u2011empted as a matter of law."
